 class  you can also just shut up if you're in  an environment where your political  beliefs may be problematic you can shut  up  if you're black there's no way you can  say oh in this environment  i will prevent people from knowing i'm  black if you  have a physical disability that puts you  in a wheelchair  you can't say that might be seen  negatively in this context  so i will just hide the fact that i'm in  a wheelchair from people  you can't do it so so my view is  do not list political beliefs as a  protected class i think religious  beliefs are a question mark but i  understand the historical reality  of religious belief and non-belief uh as  protected in the united states so i'm  not  advocating for its removal from a  protected class  let me know your thoughts on this i  think that the the the broadness  of political belief is what makes this  quite  quite complicated we've got a great  bonus show for you today  get instant access to the bonus show by  becoming a member  at joinpakman.com  you
 

